{"speciesId":467,"names":{"fr":"Maganon","es":"Magmortar","en":"Magmortar","ja":"ブーバーン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees F from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees F from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When launching 3,600 degrees F fireballs, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit out of its arms. Its breath also sears and sizzles."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit out of its arms. Its breath also sears and sizzles."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il lance des boules de feu à plus de 2 000 °C, son corps est comme chauffé à blanc."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When launching 3,600 degrees F fireballs, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il lance des boules de feu à plus de 2 000 °C, son corps est comme chauffé à blanc."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When launching 3,600 degrees F fireballs, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When shooting 3,600 degree F fireballs from its arms, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When shooting 3,600 degree F fireballs from its arms, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il projette des boules de feu à 2 000 °C à bout de bras. Il vit dans les cratères volcaniques."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus brazos disparan bolas de fuego de más de 2000 °C. Vive en cráteres volcánicos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"腕の 先から 摂氏２０００度の 火の玉を 発射する。 火山の 火口を 住処にする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il projette des boules de feu à 2 000 °C du bout de ses bras. Même son souffle est brûlant."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus brazos disparan bolas de fuego de más de 2000 °C. El aliento que desprende es abrasador."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit out of its arms. Its breath also sears and sizzles."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"摂氏２０００度の 火の玉を 腕の 先から 撃ち出す。 口から 吐く 息も 燃えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il projette des boules de feu à 2 000 °C à bout de bras. Il vit dans les cratères volcaniques."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sus brazos disparan bolas de fuego de más de 2000 °C. Vive en cráteres volcánicos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"腕の 先から 摂氏２０００度の 火の玉を 発射する。 火山の 火口を 住処にする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il projette des boules de feu à 2 000 °C du bout de ses bras. Même son souffle est brûlant."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus brazos disparan bolas de fuego de más de 2000 °C. El aliento que desprende es abrasador."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit out of its arms. Its breath also sears and sizzles."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"摂氏２０００度の 火の玉を 腕の 先から 撃ち出す。 口から 吐く 息も 燃えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il vit dans les cratères de volcans. On dit que chaque volcan ne peut abriter qu’un seul couple de Maganon."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Vive en cráteres volcánicos. Al parecer, en cada volcán solo habita una pareja de Magmortar."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They dwell in volcanic craters. According to what is known, a single pair of male and female Magmortar lives in one volcano."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"火山の 火口に 棲む。 １つの 火山には ひとつがいの ブーバーンしかいないと いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Son bras peut expulser des boules enflammées d’une température de 2 000 °C. S’il en tire trop d’un coup, son bras commence à fondre."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Expulsa bolas de fuego por los brazos que alcanzan los 2000 °C. Si lanza ráfagas, sus bazos pueden llegar a fundirse un poco."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"From its arm, it launches fireballs hotter than 3,500 degrees Fahrenheit. Its arm starts to melt when it fires a whole barrage."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"腕先から 摂氏２０００度の 火の玉を 発射。 連射を すると 腕先が 少し 溶ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il existe encore de nombreuses usines qui utilisent les flammes de Maganon pour faire fondre les métaux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"En la actualidad son aún muchas las empresas metalúrgicas que dependen de las llamas de Magmortar para trabajar el metal."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"There are still quite a few factories that rely on the flames provided by Magmortar to process metals."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"今でも 金属を 加工するのに ブーバーンの 炎に 頼っている 工場も 少なくないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il peut terrasser ses ennemis d’une seule boule de feu. Il évite toutefois de s’en servir pour chasser, car sa proie finirait carbonisée."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Expulsa bolas de fuego con las que arrolla a su enemigo y lo deja completamente chamuscado, razón por la que evita este método al cazar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Magmortar takes down its enemies by shooting fireballs, which burn them to a blackened crisp. It avoids this method when hunting prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"火の玉を 撃ちだして 敵を 仕留める。 まっくろコゲに なるので 獲物を とるときには 使わない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand il inspire profondément, les flammes dans son ventre gagnent en intensité et atteignent les 2 000 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Al respirar profundamente, el fuego del interior de su vientre gana intensidad y puede alcanzar los 2000 ºC."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When Magmortar inhales deeply, the fire burning in its belly intensifies, rising in temperature to over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"大きく 息を 吸いこむと 腹の 中の 炎が 勢いを 増して 摂氏２０００度に 達する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Au fil du temps, son corps est devenu similaire à un volcan, et un de ses organes ressemble désormais à une chambre magmatique."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Al vivir en un cráter, su cuerpo ha adquirido un aspecto similar al de un volcán y ha desarrollado un órgano parecido a una cámara magmática."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Living in the crater of a volcano has caused this Pokémon’s body to resemble its environment— it has an organ similar to a magma chamber."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"火山の 火口で 暮らすうちに マグマだまりに 似た 器官を 持つ 火山のような 体に なった。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Use of a strange item caused this Pokémon to evolve. Fireballs launched from the ends of its tubelike arms are hot enough to melt an iron pot in an instant."}],"varieties":[{"id":467,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",28],[9,"level-up",28],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",28],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",38],[14,"level-up",29],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",29],[16,"level-up",29],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",29],[18,"level-up",29],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",28],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up"